{
  "name": "o11689",
  "source": "jsonschemabench",
  "subset": "Github_medium",
  "schema": {
    "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
    "title": "Git Workflow",
    "description": "a use of branches in git called git workflow",
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
      "workflow_name",
      "branches",
      "scenarios"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "workflow_name": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "branches": {
        "description": "The list of branches who exist all the time",
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "scenarios": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/scenarios"
        }
      }
    },
    "definitions": {
      "scenarios": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "commands"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "commands": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/startCommand"
                },
                {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/finishCommand"
                },
                {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/nowCommand"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "startCommand": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "branch_start"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "enum": [
              "start"
            ]
          },
          "branch_start": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "finishCommand": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "branch_finish"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "enum": [
              "finish"
            ]
          },
          "branch_finish": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "tagOn": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "nowCommand": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "branch_start",
          "branch_finish"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "enum": [
              "now"
            ]
          },
          "branch_start": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "branch_finish": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "tagOn": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "erroneous_json": {
    "branches": [
      "master",
      "develop",
      "release",
      "hotfix"
    ],
    "scenarios": [
      {
        "name": "Feature Development",
        "commands": [
          {
            "name": "start",
            "branch_start": "develop"
          },
          {
            "name": "now",
            "branch_start": "feature/login",
            "branch_finish": [
              "develop"
            ],
            "tagOn": "v1.1.0-alpha"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Release Process",
        "commands": [
          {
            "name": "start",
            "branch_start": "develop"
          },
          {
            "name": "finish",
            "branch_finish": [
              "master",
              "develop"
            ],
            "tagOn": "v1.1.0"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "valid_json": {
    "workflow_name": "Git Flow",
    "branches": [
      "master",
      "develop",
      "release",
      "hotfix"
    ],
    "scenarios": [
      {
        "name": "Feature Development",
        "commands": [
          {
            "name": "start",
            "branch_start": "develop"
          },
          {
            "name": "now",
            "branch_start": "feature/login",
            "branch_finish": [
              "develop"
            ],
            "tagOn": "v1.1.0-alpha"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Release Process",
        "commands": [
          {
            "name": "start",
            "branch_start": "develop"
          },
          {
            "name": "finish",
            "branch_finish": [
              "master",
              "develop"
            ],
            "tagOn": "v1.1.0"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Subject: Overview of the Git Flow Workflow  \n\nThe team will be using a Git Flow workflow, anchored on four permanent branches: **master**, **develop**, **release**, and **hotfix**. These branches form the backbone of our source\u2011control strategy and will remain in place throughout the project lifecycle.  \n\nTwo common scenarios are defined. In the **Feature Development** scenario, a developer begins by branching off **develop** (`start` command) and then creates a feature branch called **feature/login**. While working on that feature, the `now` command indicates that the current work should be merged back into **develop**, and the interim build will be tagged as **v1.1.0\u2011alpha**. In the **Release Process** scenario, the release cycle also starts from **develop** (`start` command). When the release is ready, the `finish` command merges the changes into both **master** and **develop**, and the final release is marked with the tag **v1.1.0**."
}